                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " be the number of heads. The eight equally likely outcomes are TTT, TTH, THT, HTT, THH, HTH, HHT and HHH. They give ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "0,1,2,3",
